{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"libraryPage","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"actions","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO","text":"CGS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/UI","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO","text":"UI","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/UI\/LibraryPage","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11LibraryPageO","text":"LibraryPage","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/UI\/LibraryPage\/Actions","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11LibraryPageO7ActionsV","text":"Actions","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"selection","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO","text":"CGS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO","text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/Data\/Issue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO5IssueO","text":"Issue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/Data\/Issue\/Short","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO5IssueO5ShortV","text":"Short","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSUI\/documentation\/CGSUI\/CGS\/Data\/Issue\/Short\/Identifier-swift.typealias","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO5IssueO5ShortV10Identifiera","text":"Identifier","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">>? = nil) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the reader’s taps trigger."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"actions"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The issues currently ticked. Non-"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" switches the page into selection mode."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Identifiers of issues the page is not showing are left untouched, so a set that outlives a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reload keeps whatever it already held."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"selection"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing to supply. The page reads the active profile’s finished downloads off the device and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names them from the metadata each one already carries, so it needs no list of candidates and no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network — it draws the same in a tunnel as on Wi-Fi. Anything still queued, downloading, paused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or failed is left out, and a download that completes while the page is open appears on its own."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The column count follows the width the page is offered, so the same call fits an iPhone and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iPad in either orientation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most recently downloaded first: a reader who has just taken an issue offline looks for it at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the top, whatever its release date says."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The page lays out in the host’s scroll context and owns no navigation bar, so place it inside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whatever chrome the app already has."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["CGS.UI.libraryPage(","    actions: .init(onSelectIssue: { issue in \/* open the reader *\/ })",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Selecting-several-issues","text":"Selecting several issues"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Passing a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selection"},{"type":"text","text":" binding puts the page in selection mode: every cell draws a checkbox and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a tap adds or removes that issue instead of calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onSelectIssue"},{"type":"text","text":". Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" — the default —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to leave taps opening issues. An edit-mode toggle is therefore a binding the host swaps in and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out, with no separate flag to keep in step:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@State private var isEditing = false","@State private var selected: Set<CGS.Data.Issue.Short.Identifier> = []","","CGS.UI.libraryPage(","    actions: .init(onSelectIssue: { issue in \/* open the reader *\/ }),","    selection: self.isEditing ? self.$selected : nil",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Acting on the selection — deleting the downloads, and the button that does it — belongs to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host, which owns the navigation bar the page deliberately does not."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cgsui\/cgs\/ui\/librarypage(actions:selection:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"libraryPage(actions:selection:)","extendedModule":"CGSUI","roleHeading":"Type Method","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"libraryPage"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"actions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO","text":"CGS"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO","text":"UI"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11LibraryPageO","text":"LibraryPage"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11LibraryPageO7ActionsV","text":"Actions"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"selection"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO","text":"CGS"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"